  "source_text": "Create a portable vertical robot lift. The Modelica plant owns the prismatic joint dynamics and exposes lift position in meters and lift velocity in meters per second. Use a five-kilogram carriage, stiffness 100 N/m, and damping 20 N.s/m. The OpenUSD scene contains a fixed base and the carriage connected by a Z-axis prismatic joint limited from 0 to 1 meter. Drive the plant toward 0.6 meters, run it from 0 to 3 seconds at 50 Hz, and animate the USD carriage from the FMU lift-position output. The carriage must stay within its travel limits and finish within 0.02 meters of the target by 3 seconds.",
